1
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:22,589
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 16=

4
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,039
Haotian.

5
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,095
Haotian, open the door.

6
00:00:49,119 --> 00:00:50,320
- Please, just let me explain.
- (Zhao Mai's appearance)

7
00:00:50,344 --> 00:00:52,183
- It's really not what you think.
- (cost me 80 million yuan.)

8
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:54,000
- Haotian.
- (I need to divorce Lin Lulu soon)

9
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,240
- Haotian.
- (and get the half of the assets.)

10
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,039
Please open the door, Haotian.

11
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:01,240
Open the door.

12
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,079
Haotian.

13
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:03,320
Open it.

14
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:04,079
Open the door.

15
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,079
Open up.

16
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,200
Please.

17
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:07,959
Haotian.

18
00:01:08,719 --> 00:01:09,560
Haotian.

19
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,319
Haotian.

20
00:01:16,359 --> 00:01:17,280
Who are you?

21
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,159
Hello.

22
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:19,359
I'm Haotian's friend.

23
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:20,760
I just got back from North America
yesterday.

24
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:22,079
I came to discuss something with him.

25
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:23,359
But I didn't expect

26
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,040
the moment I came back, he...

27
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:26,480
What happened between you two?

28
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:27,879
Haotian has...

29
00:01:28,599 --> 00:01:29,640
What happened to Haotian?

30
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:30,280
Haotian...

31
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,439
Haotian has so many injuries
on his body.

32
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:33,519
Some of them are self-inflicted...

33
00:01:33,544 --> 00:01:34,079
No.

34
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:35,879
He was already hurting himself.

35
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:37,920
He must have been deeply hurt.

36
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,840
He's trying to use physical pain

37
00:01:39,959 --> 00:01:40,920
to cover up the mental pain.

38
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,799
Please let go.

39
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:44,079
Haotian.

40
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:44,879
Haotian.

41
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:46,256
Haotian, I'm sorry.

42
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,335
Haotian, I'm sorry.

43
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:48,359
I'm really sorry.

44
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:49,760
I'll treat you well forever.

45
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,319
Please forgive me.

46
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,000
I...

47
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:53,079
Let's go home.

48
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:55,280
Let me take care of you, okay?

49
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,004
Let's go.

50
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,200
I can't close my eyes.

51
00:01:58,799 --> 00:02:00,024
Every time I close my eyes, all I see is

52
00:02:00,049 --> 00:02:01,415
you and that man in bed.

53
00:02:01,439 --> 00:02:02,736
No, I didn't.

54
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,359
I didn't.

55
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,719
Haotian.

56
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:06,959
Lulu.

57
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:12,080
Let me go.

58
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,639
No.

59
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,400
Haotian. Haotian!

60
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,376
Haotian, no...

61
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,439
I didn't. I really didn't, Haotian.

62
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,840
I didn't... I didn't...

63
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:41,439
Who is trying to ruin me?

64
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:01,678
Zhao Ke. Zhao Ke!

65
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,800
(Yu A 88888)

66
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:12,840
I haven't felt this relaxed
in a long time.

67
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:16,120
Mai.

68
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,560
What are you thinking about?

69
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:20,280
Nothing.

70
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,599
Zhao Mai.

71
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,319
Don't worry.

72
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,560
You don't have to do anything.

73
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,319
You have to believe

74
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:31,199
that Zhao Ke will definitely
bring Zhang Haotian down.

75
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:35,120
I told you before,

76
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,879
I feel like Zhang Haotian

77
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:38,496
treats Zhao Ke

78
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,000
completely differently
from how he treated me.

79
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,840
Actually, there's something else.

80
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:45,879
It fits perfectly.

81
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,520
Thank you, babe.

82
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,240
You don't have to thank me.

83
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,319
What's wrong?

84
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:56,439
To me,

85
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:59,199
this isn't just a set of pajamas.

86
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,479
I feel like I finally have a home.

87
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:10,280
I've never known what a home feels like.

88
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,120
I've never even dared to imagine

89
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,879
what I should wear at home,

90
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,959
or what a home should have.

91
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,199
But now,

92
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,600
it feels like I've finally had it all.

93
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,240
I can feel it too.

94
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,639
Deep down,

95
00:04:32,199 --> 00:04:34,589
Zhang Haotian also longs
for a warm family.

96
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:38,480
Someone like him

97
00:04:38,839 --> 00:04:40,279
would also want a home?

98
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:42,199
For him,

99
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:43,680
wouldn't it feel like a burden?

100
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,360
A burden

101
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:47,079
could also be a kind of happiness.

102
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,480
Deep inside,

103
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,560
Zhang Haotian also longs
for the warmth of a family.

104
00:04:52,319 --> 00:04:54,000
Something must have happened to him

105
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,279
to turn him into the person he is today.

106
00:04:58,839 --> 00:04:59,399
Alright.

107
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,920
Let's not talk about this anymore.

108
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,199
Let's go look around?

109
00:05:02,839 --> 00:05:03,319
Okay.

110
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,519
Where did you hit?

111
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,519
- It's okay.
- Does it hurt?

112
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,839
I'm fine.

113
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:41,776
Zhao Ke, you set me up.

114
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,976
Why would I set you up?

115
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,536
Because you want to seduce my husband,

116
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,480
to take my place,

117
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,240
and become Mrs. Zhang.

118
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,199
I'm warning you.

119
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,495
If you dare use these despicable tricks
again,

120
00:05:51,519 --> 00:05:52,639
I'll make you die!

121
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,199
Instead of worrying about this,

122
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,759
you should find out

123
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,576
who sent the video of Zhang Haotian
and me

124
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,439
to you.

125
00:06:00,199 --> 00:06:01,639
Wasn't it you who sent the video?

126
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,295
The thief cries "thief".

127
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:04,735
You did something shameful
and still pretend to be innocent.

128
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:05,576
How could there be

129
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,839
someone as shameless as you?

130
00:06:06,959 --> 00:06:08,935
I didn't send you the video.

131
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:10,319
And I never tried to frame you.

132
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,560
But I suggest you look
into these two things.

133
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,319
You might even uncover

134
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,375
the truth behind

135
00:06:15,399 --> 00:06:17,336
your mother's death, Ms. Su.

136
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,959
You have the nerve to mention my mother?

137
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:20,976
Why did my mother call you?

138
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,415
Why did she collapse
right after calling you?

139
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:23,375
Tell me why.

140
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:24,495
Tell me why!

141
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:25,399
Calm down.

142
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,519
Lin Lulu!

143
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:33,759
The kidney your mother received

144
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:36,096
was taken from a girl

145
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,040
named Jiang Lai.

146
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:42,120
It was your husband, Zhang Haotian,
who tricked her with love to get it.

147
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:45,839
And I...

148
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,480
have more in common with that girl.

149
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,279
What do you mean?

150
00:06:53,319 --> 00:06:56,040
If you don't understand, forget it.

151
00:07:05,203 --> 00:07:07,231
(The Divorce Trap)

152
00:07:07,699 --> 00:07:11,999
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

153
00:07:12,807 --> 00:07:15,619
♪I should forget you♪

154
00:07:16,088 --> 00:07:21,165
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

155
00:07:21,189 --> 00:07:23,029
♪To carry on♪

156
00:07:23,285 --> 00:07:28,142
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

157
00:07:28,508 --> 00:07:30,396
♪You no longer have the strength♪

158
00:07:32,695 --> 00:07:35,576
♪You want me to go there for you♪

159
00:07:37,144 --> 00:07:42,582
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

160
00:07:43,176 --> 00:07:46,315
♪Your freedom♪

161
00:07:47,015 --> 00:07:51,446
♪Has become my cage♪

162
00:07:52,374 --> 00:07:58,165
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

163
00:07:59,516 --> 00:08:05,366
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

164
00:08:05,829 --> 00:08:11,776
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

165
00:08:12,056 --> 00:08:15,306
♪You told me♪

166
00:08:15,703 --> 00:08:20,209
♪I would shine like a star♪

167
00:08:21,053 --> 00:08:25,600
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

168
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:29,250
♪How to live without you♪

169
00:08:29,469 --> 00:08:35,294
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

170
00:08:36,815 --> 00:08:40,599
♪So hazy and blurred♪
